Comments:
    A cool blob of material falling in a stratified background. Gravity points
    in the direction of increasing z. Stratification is controlled by cs0.
    This sample tests using a cylindrical grid that extends up to r=0.
    
    (20-Nov-2026) checked that the sample is independent of the compiler optimization level:
    - `pc_auto-test -C --config-files=GNU-GCC_MPI,GNU-GCC_optimal .`
    - `pc_auto-test -C --config-files=GNU-GCC_MPI,GNU-GCC_debug .`
    both pass.
